{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51039","headline":"禅诗 四 · 无名僧","name":"禅诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清莲台上见天唐，衆生真心礼肆芳。\n降摩处上夜放光，菩萨悲愿遍什芳。\n（以上四首见伯二一二九卷，前三首抄於一处，第四首另抄。\n第三首第二句，似应作「行直何须坐禅」。\n第四句「漠然」，原卷作「叹然」，疑应作「懽然」。\n第五句「凉药」应作「良药」。\n第四首中「肆芳」、「什芳」，通「四方」、「十方」。）","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}